<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche H1 group net profit rises 15.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Roche H1 group net profit rises 15.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net profit	     2,213	     vs 1,912</p>
<p> Gross profit		   5,390	     vs 5,234</p>
<p> Research &amp; development     1,128	     vs 1,181</p>
<p> Operating profit	     1,953	     vs 1,815</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Swiss pharmaceuticals group is Roche Holding AG. Analysts on average had forecast a 17.3 percent rise in net profit.</p>
</text>
